cs it was just a one a  Wednesday program I was absolutely  horrified that somebody might write to  me and be mad that I said something they  disagree with or they might leave an  angry youtube comment or something like  that it was scary to me and I sort of  tried to play the show down the middle  for a while for a few weeks where I  would report the news and I would say  the left says this and the right  this and kind of leave it there and it  was a very boring show and it was also  unsatisfying because of course I had  opinions and I was keeping them to  myself and not really stating them  because of this fear and also people got  mad anyway right people people disagreed  that there were two sides to many  stories and they were mad that I  presented both sides as if they were  equal so the point is I quickly realized  that that couldn't be the show it wasn't  a satisfying way to me to do the show  and it wasn't very useful either because  I have an opinion that I want to get out  there so that this very quickly became  an opinion program and of course now I'm  used to the attacks and the anti-semitic  comments and thousands of mm-hmm excuse  me angry angry YouTube comments a day or  whatever the case may be but over the  last three to twelve months it's become  very clear that there is now a slice of  the left that is not going to accept any  position other than their position and  they won't stop calling me a DNC shill  or other terms unless I take their  positions and what I want to tell you  today is that it's not going any further  you're not going to be satisfied with  this program and maybe this isn't the  program for you let me give you some  examples okay right now these are maybe  relevant examples one is the never Biden  crowd okay the never Biden crowd is  never going to be satisfied with what I  say unless I join them and say I'm never  gonna vote for Biden now I'm not going  to do that at this point based on what  we know it's conceivable Joe Biden could  go on a killing spree or something and  I'd change my mind  but it's become clear that no matter how  I couch the reality that based on  everything I know right now Biden's  clearly better than Trump and I plan to  vote for Biden I could talk about the  Supreme Court doesn't matter it doesn't  matter what I say unless I refuse to  vote for Biden there's a very loud  contingent that shows up on my Twitter  and reddit and whatever they're not  going to be happy now the good news is  they represent a pretty small portion of  my audience and a pretty small portion  of the left but this is not going to be  a program for these folks and they will  call me a Democratic DNC shill unless I  say never Biden which of course helps  Donald Trump not gonna do it let's talk  about another example this relates to a  woman named Tara Reid  Tara Reid says Joe Biden sexually  assaulted her in 1993 now there was a  period of about seven to ten days where  I had a contingent contacting me  increasingly angrily saying David you're  terrible you're a shill because you're  not covering her allegations now over  time more and more clips have published  to my youtube channel now I believe it's  six in total where Tara Reid's  allegations are discussed has this  satisfied this slice of the left no of  course not because I'm talking about  Tara Reid now but I'm not saying the  right thing which I guess is Joe Biden's  a rapist and I'm not voting for him but  of course I'm not going to say that Joe  Biden hasn't been convicted of rape he's  not even accused of rape if I understand  the allegations correctly and the  reality is that either Joe Biden or  Donald Trump are going to be President  of the United States on dozens of issues  I prefer Biden now this is not some big  theatrical defiant performance for me  I'm living my life I'm doing the show in  advocating for the policies I support  and in November I will essentially have  two choices and I've made clear as of  right now which choice I'm going to make  I've not attacked Tara Reid's  credibility I've not come out and said  her story makes no sense I've not done  any of those things but this contingent  didn't really want me to just talk about  Tara Reid they want me to say never  Biden and they won't be satisfied until  I say that this is no way to run a show  if I'm going to kowtow to these slices  of the left that are hell-bent on  getting specific statements out of me I  could do every show about Tara Reid but  it's not just about covering it it's  about taking their position and if I  don't I'm a DNC shill and a bad person  this probably isn't the show for you  we've seen this in some other cases as  well I won't spend a lot of time on  these but when it comes to the Maduro  regime in Venezuela you know I've  pointed out the rhetoric that started  with Hugo Chavez it was very left  populist rhetoric it became an  authoritarian nightmare a corrupt  judiciary it can't be trusted the  country's resources have been raped and  pillaged by elites to the exclusion of  the majority and people write to me and  say David how dare you support American  intervention in Venezuela and I say no  I'm from South America I'm very well  acquainted with the history of the  region that is  masters of American intervention but  Chavez was no hero and Maduro is no hero  and that they've been bad for the  country and they hate it so it's not  really about I support American  intervention which they know I don't  it's that I'm not praying at the altar  of Maduro they will never be satisfied  recently george w bush came out with  this just milquetoast statement about  unity around coronavirus and i said hey  george w bush is a war criminal but  compared to trump he sounds like a  normal person it's not praise of bush  i'm not rehabilitation as image and  immediately dozens of comments and  hundreds of Twitter and Facebook posts  saying you are rehabilitating the image  of a war criminal they will never be  satisfied unless I always say there is  no way in which Bush is better than  Trump  so my renewed effort is and this is my  pledge I don't care about what these  people think and I'm not going to let it  dictate the show you can leave me  comments on YouTube or tweet me write me  email you know whatever maybe this just  isn't the show for you like I I don't  watch political shows like mine but  there must be some show that takes these  positions right like if you're looking  for an ever Biden show is there a bite  and never Biden show out there I assume  there is or if you're looking for oh we  love Maduro show or I'm guessing that  these shows exist much like I can't open  the eyes of a devout trumpet they're  closed off  so are these leftists on this slice of  the left and it's sad but I can't  control it all I can control is my show  and I apologize that over the last three  months there's been a naivete where I  thought maybe there would be some way  but it doesn't seem like there is  they're not going to be satisfied  everybody should watch the shows they  want read what you want come to your  conclusion conclusions but we're gonna  do the show this way and that's the way  it's going to be now let's get to  something positive which relates to  really great changes for the show that's  the next thing if you love feeding your  intellectual curiosity but you're always  struggling to find the time check out  one of my alt  favorite apps called blinka stinkiest  lets you consume an entire book on your  way home from work  they take thousands of popular  nonfiction books condense each one into  text or audio that you can get through  in just 15 minutes and you get all of  the important core ideas and information  from that book it's perfect if you don't  have enough time to do all the reading  you want to do or if you just want to  sample a book before you buy the entire  thing I recently read a brief history of  time of course by the great Stephen  Hawking this is a book that I have been  aware of for so long and other things  got in the way and it was fantastic  to check it out on blinkin blink east  has books on politics philosophy science  they have 27 different nonfiction  categories and a subscription is only  about eight bucks a month and you get  the entire library but you can try it  totally free and get 25 percent off a  subscription when you go to blink is  comm slash Pakman I've put the link  right underneath this video

